          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What's the actual difference between the Commercial 2450 and the Commercial 1750?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              The 2450 steps up to a 4.25 CHP motor from 3.75 CHP, extends
              max incline from 12% to 15%, and swaps the 1750's 14-inch
              touchscreen for a 24-inch display. Deck size and weight
              capacity are identical between the two, so the upgrade is
              concentrated in motor strength, incline range, and screen
              size.
            </p>
